  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greater Noakhali and Chittagong Districts Feeder Road Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at providing better transport facilities through construction/reconstruction of feeder Roads and Rural roads including bridges/culverts to facilitate increased socioeconomic activities in the rural areas and to enhance the economic and commercial importance of the Growth Centres, Rural markets through improvement of their physical facilities.</narrative>
